{"slug":"aws-online-training","id":"1950","title":"AWS Online Training","description":"<h3>About AWS Online Training</h3>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">Amazon Web Services (AWS) may be a comprehensive, widely adopted, and secured on-demand cloud platform offered by Amazon. <strong>AWS Online Training</strong>  cloud platform is developed with a mixture of cloud services like platform as a service (PaaS), software as a service(SaaS), and infrastructure as a service(IaaS). These services are designed to figure together in building sophisticated and scalable applications that are delivered over the web .</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">AWS offers quite 165 fully-featured services. So, you’ll have access to the highly durable storage, high-performance databases, low-cost compute, application services, deployment, analytics, and tools to manage all the resources that are available with the upfront cost for a specific use.</p>\n<h4>Prerequisites For Learning AWS Online Training</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>no specific prerequisites for AWS certification training</li>\n<li>Having basic knowledge in any of the programming languages is also recommended.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Terms And Conditions</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>We will Provide Supporting to resolve Student practical Issues.</li>\n<li>We will provide server Access and 100% Lab Facility.</li>\n<li>Resume Preparation.</li>\n<li>Interview Questions &amp; Answers.</li>\n<li>We will conduct mock interviews. Student also gets 100% supporting before and after getting job.</li>\n</ul>","curriculumInfo":"1 Section18 Lessons10 Weeks","sections":[{"id":"3","title":"AWS Online Training Course Content","count":"18","collapsed":true,"items":[{"id":"3448","order":1,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/aws-online-training/lessons/lesson-1-introduction-of-cloud-computing-aws-2/","number":"2.1","title":"Lesson 1: Introduction of Cloud Computing & AWS","status":"locked"},{"id":"3449","order":2,"type":"lp_lesson","url":"/courses/aws-online-training/less